  "name": "Fat-Free Vegetable Soup",
  "subtitle": "A hearty vegetable soup with cabbage, tomatoes, and curry",
  "description": "A generous pot of vegetables simmered with tomatoes, dill, curry, and black pepper for a warming, broth-based soup.",
